in French or it has to be French first and

00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:35.299
larger?

00:03:35.299 --> 00:03:43.069
Speaker 3: Well, in the 70s, they tried to
make it only and the French.

00:03:43.069 --> 00:03:46.849
And the Supreme Court of Canada said you're
not allowed to do that.

00:03:46.849 --> 00:03:49.109
That's infringing on freedom of speech.

00:03:49.109 --> 00:03:50.109
OK.

00:03:50.109 --> 00:03:52.810
And so today it's predominantly French.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:59.400
That means you can put it in English, but
the font has to be smaller than the French

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.319
understood, I think.

00:04:01.319 --> 00:04:07.040
I think there's an exception in the native
communities where you are allowed to have

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:13.639
signed the Jews only and like Inuit or you're
on the right stuff like that because, yeah,

00:04:13.639 --> 00:04:18.420
